1
00:00:00,775 --> 00:00:01,845
(Leonard:)Butterfly could've
gotten himself

2
00:00:01,842 --> 00:00:04,272
(Leonard:)home from Arizona.

3
00:00:05,813 --> 00:00:07,343
(Sheldon:)Yeah, I feel renewed.

4
00:00:07,348 --> 00:00:08,348
(Sheldon:)I'm ready

5
00:00:08,349 --> 00:00:09,479
(Sheldon:)to deal with any changes

6
00:00:09,483 --> 00:00:10,713
(Sheldon:)that come my way.

7
00:00:11,419 --> 00:00:13,149
Hey!
Hey!

8
00:00:13,154 --> 00:00:14,684
Look who's back!

9
00:00:14,689 --> 00:00:16,289
(Penny:)Your hair is different.
You changed your hair.

10
00:00:16,290 --> 00:00:18,620
(Sheldon:)I can't take this.
I'm out.

11
00:00:22,963 --> 00:00:25,063
(Sheldon:)Would you like to see pictures
from my trip?

12
00:00:25,066 --> 00:00:26,536
(Penny:)I thought your
phone got stolen.

13
00:00:26,534 --> 00:00:28,434
(Sheldon:)Yeah, it did,
but luckily all my photos

14
00:00:28,436 --> 00:00:30,536
(Sheldon:)got backed up to the Cloud.

15
00:00:30,538 --> 00:00:33,768
(Leonard:)And you thought they
all had a silver lining.

16
00:00:33,774 --> 00:00:35,174
(Sheldon:)Here... day one.

17
00:00:35,176 --> 00:00:36,546
(Sheldon:)Uh, this was the seat

18
00:00:36,544 --> 00:00:38,444
(Sheldon:)I was going to sit in but didn't

19
00:00:38,446 --> 00:00:41,176
(Sheldon:)because there were
cracker crumbs on it.

20
00:00:41,182 --> 00:00:44,352
(Sheldon:)As it was first class,
I suspect Ritz.

21
00:00:45,786 --> 00:00:49,026
(Sheldon:)This is the train bathroom.

22
00:00:49,023 --> 00:00:50,753
(Sheldon:)This is the Imodium I took

23
00:00:50,758 --> 00:00:53,388
(Sheldon:)so I would never have
to use the train bathroom.

24
00:00:53,394 --> 00:00:55,164
(Penny:)I cannot believe

25
00:00:55,162 --> 00:00:56,632
you traveled the
entire country

26
00:00:56,630 --> 00:00:58,030
(Leonard:)and never left
the train station.

27
00:00:58,032 --> 00:01:00,032
(Sheldon:)I know.
You know, I almost died

28
00:01:00,034 --> 00:01:03,034
(Sheldon:)in a fire in Des Moines,
but I stayed put.

29
00:01:03,037 --> 00:01:04,807
(Sheldon:)FYI...

30
00:01:04,805 --> 00:01:07,375
(Sheldon:)That's when
the Imodium gave out.

